<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-BOTHAM JUNIOR EARNS ENGLAND CALL-UP.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-BOTHAM JUNIOR EARNS ENGLAND CALL-UP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liam Botham, son of former England cricket captain Ian Botham, has been drafted into England's under-21 rugby union squad for the match against France in Leicester on Friday.</p>
<p>Botham, who plays centre for West Hartlepool, decided on a rugby career after initially playing cricket for county side Hampshire.</p>
